     3	/// What a scope's frame holds (spec §11 HD-8, HD-15): `sdr`, Rec. 709 encoded
     4	/// values, every SDR project's frame and an HLG project's SDR version; `hlg`,
     5	/// an HLG project's own picture, BT.2020 HLG-encoded values. It picks the
